            "review_title": "Review at Bún Riêu Nguyễn Cảnh Chân",
            "review_text": "Shawn W\nSingapore, Singapore93 contributions\n0\nDelicious Broth That Takes My Breath Away\nFeb 2025 • Friends\nThis shop selling Bun Rieu is somewhere I will always come to eat whenever I visit Ho Chi Minh City. So far, I have visited this city 3 times, and never failed to skip this eating spot.\n\nThe amazing flavour of the crab+tomato+pork broth is simply out of this world. I can never get anything that can taste even close back home in Singapore. The default serving comes with a meat ball, a piece of pig trotter, and a large wedge of pig blood curd served with thick bee hoon in their delicious broth.\n\nIf you do not take blood curd, remember to ask them to omit it.\n\nI could really eat this everyday if I lived where the shop is located. There isn't really much else to do in the vicinity. It is a meal that is good for lunch. I look forward to my next trip to HCMC partly because of the Bun Rieu.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 20, 2025",
